# Save replay (after a game): a 1200 x 800 dialog centred on a 40% scrim (x 360..1560, y 140..940): title, the list of
# existing replays, the name entry, Back and Save. The "replay saved" notice is a small dialog of its own, shown by code.
hide $PopupReplayMenu
scrim
window $PopupReplaySubMenu centre middle 0 0 1200 800 dialog
window $MenuButtonFrame left top 360 140 1200 800
hide $MenuButtonFrame
hide $Line

window $StaticTextTitle left top 384 164 800 32 section
rule left top 384 204 1152
window $ListboxGames left top 384 220 1152 520 list
window $TextEntryReplayName left top 384 764 1152 44 entry

window $ButtonBack left top 384 860 180 44 button
window $ButtonSave left top 1356 860 180 44 primary

window $PopupReplaySaved centre middle 0 0 760 200 dialog
window $StaticReplaySaved left top 604 520 712 40 label
